{"page":{"id":"c18ec504-b95b-41ae-81f4-cc6f7bc6e32a","theme":"pathfinder","slug":"/pathfinder/paizo","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/pathfinder/paizo","title":"Paizo","meta_title":"Paizo (Pathfinder) — organization, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Paizo Publishing produces Pathfinder rulebooks, Adventure Paths, organized play, and the Starfinder RPG, building on decades of fantasy RPG design. Related…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Publisher of <a href=\"/pathfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder</a> and <a href=\"/pathfinder/starfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Starfinder</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Pathfinder</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/starfinder\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Starfinder</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Adventure Paths</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/eric-mona\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Eric Mona</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-first-edition\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Pathfinder First Edition</strong></a> and <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-society\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Pathfinder Society</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Paizo connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Publishes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder</a>\n            — Paizo publishes <a href=\"/pathfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Publishes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/starfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Starfinder</a>\n            — Paizo also publishes <a href=\"/pathfinder/starfinder\" class=\"entity-link\">Starfinder</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths\" class=\"entity-link\">Adventure Paths</a>\n            — Paizo is connected to <a href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths\" class=\"entity-link\">Adventure Paths</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/eric-mona\" class=\"entity-link\">Eric Mona</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/eric-mona\" class=\"entity-link\">Eric Mona</a> is connected to Paizo through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-first-edition\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder First Edition</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-first-edition\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder First Edition</a> is connected to Paizo through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-society\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder Society</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-society\" class=\"entity-link\">Pathfinder Society</a> is connected to Paizo through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths/rise-of-the-runelords\" class=\"entity-link\">Rise of the Runelords</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths/rise-of-the-runelords\" class=\"entity-link\">Rise of the Runelords</a> is connected to Paizo through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/goblins\" class=\"entity-link\">Goblins</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/goblins\" class=\"entity-link\">Goblins</a> is connected to Paizo through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">6</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/adventure-paths\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Adventure Paths</strong>\n                    <span>Serialized multi-volume campaign arcs.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/eric-mona\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Eric Mona</strong>\n                    <span>Editor and world-builder of Golarion lore.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/pathfinder-first-edition\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Pathfinder First Edition</strong>\n                    <span>Original Pathfinder RPG rules (2009).</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n    