ths/rise-of-the-runelords\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Rise of the Runelords\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Rise of the Runelords is connected to Paizo through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/goblins\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Goblins\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Goblins is connected to Paizo through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Publishes</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">2</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Publishes\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Pathfinder</strong>\n                    <span>Paizo&#039;s fantasy RPG of Golarion, Adventure Paths, and the Pathfinder Society.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/starfinder\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Publishes\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Starfinder</strong>\n                    <span>Paizo&#039;s science-fantasy RPG spinoff.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n     